    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgabanhyiwa kwa sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulīyītūlīgīja mbale ī sī kūlwa kūgaba wingīji, mukūsola ibudīka ly'ibbaala mumfunīje SEEBA ībize sī neela; ū būlīhu walyo līkūbiza kilomita ikūmi n'ibīlī na nusu, ū būgalī galī kilomita ikūmi; ī libbaala lyenīlo līkūbiza lyeela pyī ī lyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wibbala lyenīlo sī ya būlīhu bo miita magana abīlī na makūmi atanò nū būgalī galī būlī gīko īkūbiza y'ipandī lyeela; īkūpīndīlījiwa na sī ītī na shikolo, ya būgalī galī bo miita makūmi abīlī n'itanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu sī neela ūkūpima ibbaala lya būlīhu bo kilomita ikūmi n'ibīlī na nusu, būgalī galī kilomita itanò. Ū ng'wenūmo h'ūmo līkūbiza ī lipandī lyeela, īlo līlī lyeela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lyenīlo ibbaala lya sī neela kūlwa bagabīji, a batūmami ba ng'wipandī lyeela, abo bakeegeelaga kūlī SEEBA kūtūmama kū būtongi bokwe. Līkūbiza ibbaala lya kūzenga ho numba jabo, na līkūbiza ipandī lyeela kūlwa hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hekalu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ipandī lyeela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibbaala lya būlīhu bo kilomita ikūmi n'ibīlī na nusu na būgalī galī bo kilomita itanò līkūbiza lya Balawī, abo bakatūmamaga mu hekalu; līkūbiza sabo yabo kūlwa mizengo yabo ya kwikala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo ūkūgwinha sī yaago, ya būgalī galī bo kilomita ibīlī na nusu, na būlīhu bo kilomita ikūmi n'ibīlī na nusu, ībīmbīkanwe nī libbaala lya sī neela; ī yenīyo sabo ya banhū bose ba numba ya Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsugi akūbiza na sī yakwe; ī libbaala lya kū lwande lwa sī neela nī lya kū lwande lwa sī ya nzengo līkūbiza lyakwe. Ū kū lwande lo ng'weli līkūlola ng'weli, nū kū lwande lo kīya lyūlola kīya; ū mu būlīhu līhu walyo līkūfuma kū lūbīmbī lo ng'weli lyūshika kū lūbīmbī lo kīya; lyūja lihelile n'īmò ya sī ījo jigabilwe kū ng'anda ja Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī yenīyī īkūbiza sabo yakwe ū mu Isilaeli, hūna lūūlū a basugi bane batūbiza na nguno ya kūbiboneela a banhū bane, alīyo bakūzunya ī sī īgabanhyiwe ū kū banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli kūlenganīla na kwihela kwa ng'anda jabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Bing'we basugi ba Isilaeli ng'wigegije lūūlū! Lekanagi nabo ū būluhya nū wiboneeji, ng'wandye kwīta mu būdeeba na būtūngīlīja. Oyagi ū kūbasaamya a banhū bane; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmamīlagi shipimo shitūngīlīgije, ī gapani ītūngīlīje nī shibabà shibize sha būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Efa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shaalī shipimo sha kūpimīla būdito bo shikolo shūūmu; gītī mahalage (lita 22).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nī baat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baat:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shaalī shipimo sha kūpimīla būdito bo shikolo sha minzī minzī; gītī maguta (lita 22).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shibize na shipimo sha mpango gūmò; ī baat īlī na īmò y'ikūmi ya homeli, nī efa īlī na īmò y'ikūmi ya homeli; ī homeli h'ībize ngelekelo ya kūlenganīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shekeli īmò īkūbiza na geela makūmi abīlī, ī miina īmò shekeli makūmi atandatū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Miina īmò shekeli makūmi atandatū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bakatūūlilwa miina mhya, īyo yatūmamaga na kale yalī na shekeli makūmi atanò.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha na shikū nhaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha īsho mukūyūfunya shiishi, shikūbiza īmò ya ng'witandatū ya efa ū mu homeli īmò ya ngano, na īmò ya ng'witandatū ya efa ū mu homeli īmò ya būsīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabo gwa maguta ūyo gūtūūlilwe ho gūkūgelekwa mu ngelekelo ya baat, gūlī īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya baat kūfuma mu būlī koli (ī koli ītikīlile na homeli īmò; būlī yene īlī na baat ikūmi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'holo īmò īkūsolwa kūfuma mu būlī idaale lya ng'holo magana abīlī, ū mu ng'holo ja kū madīīmīlo ga maswa mafulumu ga mu sī ya Isilaeli. Ī shenīshi shikūbiza kūlwa kūfunya shitambò sha būsu, shitambò sha kūpemvwa, na shitambò sha būsangī; kūlwa kūbabeegeja isangī a banhū, alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū ba sī bakūsangīla ū mu kūshifunya ī shakwinha shenīshi kūlwa shitūmamīlo sha nsugi wa sī ya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūkūbiza nīmo gwa nsugi ū kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa, nī shitambò sha būsu nī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa, ū mu makanza ga shigukulu, mu shikū ja Ng'weji Mpya, nū mu shikū ja sabato, ū mu shigukulu shose īsho shitūūlilwe ho kūlwa numba ya Isilaeli. Akūshifunya ī shitambò sha kweja shibi, nī sha būsu, nī sha kūpemvwa, nī shitambò sha būsangī kūlwa kwībeegeja isangī ī numba ya Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwandya lwa ng'weji gwa kwandya ūkūsola nzagamba songi ītī na shilingo, ūlyeeje ī lipandī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūsola mininga gamò a ga shitambò sha kweja shibi, ūbilīja a ha mitī ya mu kabazu ī ya ha nyango gwa hekalu; na a ha mhembeelo ja h'ikīgījo lya higūlya a ha ng'walīlo, na a ha ng'hīngī ja ha mita go gwalugwa ya mu gatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī lwa ng'weji ūkwīta gīko, kūlwa munhū ose ose ūyo wīta shibi mu kūhūbīla nūūlū mu būtūmana; hūna lūūlū ū mu gīko ūkwītūūlīla isangī ī hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
